   "title": "Cleans and sanitizes all hard floors in one pass — no chemicals needed",
   "body": "With two toddlers on the floor all day, chemical residues were a big concern. This steam mop uses only water and heats to 145°C, killing 99.9% of bacteria. The washable microfiber pad lasts through dozens of washes. See the steam action photos.",
